      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Temporary work around that worked for me, hope this helps you until there is a permanent fix.  I used a community binding called 'SteamVR 1.6.10 WMR VRC Bindings V2.0 and then edited the right controller bindings to force the 'A' button when you push on the DPAD.  This allows movement to still work on the sticks, but lets you push on the DPAD when you want to jump.  It disables rotating from the DPAD however, but this is something I rarely use anyway.  Gestures still work when touching the DPAD",
